A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the tower defense strategy known as '''No Longer MOMOTARO''' (桃太郎失格, ''Momotarō Shikkaku '', '''Momotaro Disqualified''') was held from April 17th, 2023 to March 8th, 2023.<br>
The game is published by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]].

